      "statement": "The extractor authenticates to OpenRouter with a single environment variable, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, loaded from .env by python-dotenv at import time in src/knowledge_extractor/cli.py; if the key is unset, AIClient is created with client=None and AI steps are skipped while raw extractions are still written to output.",
